                "message": "CI: make success gates fail on cancelled jobs and detector failures\n\nUse 'if: ${{ !cancelled() }}' for ci-early-success, ci-success and\nsanitizers-success so that a cancelled need (e.g. a job hitting its\ntimeout) makes the gate run and fail instead of skipping it, and add\nfile-changes to their needs so a failed change detection fails the gate.\n\nFixes #8110.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Vx41jkTKgrWAx3u5A78K5p",
                "tree": {
